      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "islamophobia_association",
      "label": "Islamophobia Association",
      "description": "The presence of women wearing hijabs in the image implicitly references the stereotype of Islamophobia, which often associates Muslim women with oppression or backwardness. While the image does not explicitly depict any negative stereotypes, the context of the meme (which uses violent language) can be interpreted as potentially reinforcing harmful associations with Muslim women or communities, especially when combined with the violent metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_948c3191"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_30e54e37",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "misogyny_association",
      "label": "Misogyny Association",
      "description": "The image of a pregnant woman being touched on her belly by another woman, combined with the text 'is it a boy or a girl', can be interpreted as reinforcing the stereotype that women are primarily defined by their reproductive roles. This can be seen as a form of misogyny, as it reduces the woman's identity to her body and the potential for childbirth, potentially limiting her perceived agency or value beyond motherhood.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_948c3191"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_a71d1809",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "shock",
      "label": "shocking emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is shock, primarily conveyed through the juxtaposition of the joyful, anticipatory pregnancy reveal scene with the violent and unexpected text 'it's a bomb'. The contrast between the tender moment and the crude metaphor creates a jarring, shocking effect intended to provoke strong emotional reaction.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
