      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet humor, particularly dark humor and shock-value memes. The target community includes individuals who appreciate crude, exaggerated, or jarring analogies for comedic effect, often found in meme culture. The visual of a pregnancy reveal paired with a violent metaphor is likely intended to provoke laughter through its absurdity and shock, appealing to users who enjoy edgy or offensive humor.",
